{"format":"megamek-board","version":3,"size":{"width":30,"height":30},"name":"Road Network","description":"Complex road, rail and bridge compositions over terraced ground. North-west: a road and centred railway climbing over a terraced hill, crossing a road at its summit, with a T junction on its slope. North-east: the road and railway crossing a river valley on a bridge between banks at different levels, over a valley road, with a T junction at the bridge mouth. South-west: a concrete city on terraced blocks, with a beside railway, junctions across level changes and a sloped apron. South-east: an elevated road bridge over a road and railway corridor, with a climbing link road and junctions beside both bridge mouths. Inspect in Classic and Enhanced.","options":{"exitRoadsToPavement":false},"tags":["Example"],"notes":[{"at":[8,8],"text":["Hill crossroads"]},{"at":[23,8],"text":["River crossing"]},{"at":[8,23],"text":["Concrete city"]},{"at":[23,23],"text":["Interchange"]}],
